      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7514646::web::000::abstract",
        "PMC7514646::web::003::1_introduction",
        "PMC7514646::web::014::4_conclusions"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "A target coating thickness of approximately 10–20 μm is suitable for the proposed W–Cu composite.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7514646::web::014::4_conclusions"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The coated W–Cu composite should be consolidated by SPS at approximately 1600 °C under a reducing atmosphere.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "SPS of HEA-coated tungsten particles will form a thin, graded HEA interlayer at the W/Cu interface.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7514646::web::003::1_introduction",
        "PMC7514646::web::014::4_conclusions"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The graded interlayer will improve wettability at the W/Cu interface.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The graded interlayer will improve interfacial bonding between tungsten and copper.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7514646::web::000::abstract",
        "PMC7514646::web::003::1_introduction",
        "PMC7514646::web::014::4_conclusions"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The HEA interlayer will act as a diffusion barrier under irradiation.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The HEA coating will enhance beneficial interfacial diffusion and chemical compatibility between W and Cu.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7514646::web::003::1_introduction",
        "PMC7514646::web::014::4_conclusions"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The HEA coating will reduce the driving force for W–Cu phase separation.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The HEA coating will prevent or reduce interfacial void formation.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7514646::web::003::1_introduction",
        "PMC7514646::web::014::4_conclusions"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The HEA interlayer will mitigate interdiffusion-related degradation during irradiation.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The HEA-coated composite will have significantly fewer interfacial voids and defects than the conventional vapor-coated W-powder baseline.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7514646::web::000::abstract",
        "PMC7514646::web::003::1_introduction",
        "PMC7514646::web::014::4_conclusions"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The HEA-coated composite will have higher thermal conductivity than the conventional vapor-coated W-powder baseline.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The HEA-coated composite will have greater mechanical durability under irradiation than the conventional vapor-coated W-powder baseline.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
